# Era 3 of The Quota (Allocation, year 20; design/eras/era3.md): its twelve places wired as areas on their own
# plates (plates package, 2026-10-22; render/places/q3_*.mjs, baked by render/bake_era3.sh). Loaded by the shell beside
# wiring/quota-areas.lwd and era1-areas.lwd (ui/app.mjs content=quota).
# hud-clock and hud-weather: the hour and weather the HUD shows here while @meta hud-held holds (era 3 nodes cost no
# minutes on era 2's day clock, so without them the HUD read era 2's frost and a Wednesday clock), read by ui/hudtab.mjs.
# The Well House shows its burning plate once the fire scene has begun (e3_fever.lwd, e3.well.decide).
# No figures yet: era 3's cast has no sculpted figures; the scenes' speakers show on the talk page only.

@area q3.tower
name: The bell tower over Exchange Street
plate: q3_tower
place: q3_tower
lens: wide
variant: morning
hud-clock: 09:10
hud-weather: September, a dry wind
spawn: 0 0 1.5
camera: 0.6

@area q3.square
name: The square at the scale
plate: q3_square
place: q3_square
lens: wide
variant: noon
hud-clock: 12:10
hud-weather: September, dust off the plain
spawn: -3 0 -2
camera: 0.6

@area q3.well_house
name: The Well House, in Pask's rented yard
plate: q3_well_house
plate: q3_well_fire ? seen(e3.well.decide) | has(e3.door_barred) | has(e3.door_opened)
place: q3_well_house
lens: wide
variant: fire ? seen(e3.well.decide) | has(e3.door_barred) | has(e3.door_opened)
variant: dusk
hud-clock: 16:40
hud-weather: November, a cold wind
spawn: -0.2 0 1.9
camera: 0.6

@area q3.school
name: The schoolroom in the old exchange offices
plate: q3_school
place: q3_school
lens: narrow
variant: morning
hud-clock: 10:30
hud-weather: September, grey
spawn: 1.9 0 1.7
camera: 0.9

